#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:106
msgid "Minutes to count the requests of a file by a visitor as a single hit"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:107
msgid ""
"A file is requested many times for a single view: probe, ranges of an audio "
"or video file, preload, replay. A long media read continuously still counts "
"a new hit when the window expires, so increase it for long videos or audio "
"books. Empty or zero disables the deduplication."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:119
msgid ""
"Record the requested zones of images and parts of audio and video files "
"(heat map)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:120
msgid ""
"The requests of the tiles of the images and the partial requests of the "
"audio and video files are aggregated by month in the table "
"\"analytics_segment\", to identify the most viewed zones and the most played "
"parts. They are never counted as hits."
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:131
msgid "Include crawlers/bots"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:132
msgid ""
"By checking this box, all hits which user agent contains the term \"bot\", "
"\"crawler\", \"spider\", etc. will be included."
msgstr ""

