#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:239
msgid "Clean past hits once (deduplicate files, remove regions of images)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:240
msgid ""
"Run the task that deduplicates the past hits of files and removes the hits "
"of the regions of the images (tiles), then rebuilds the statistics, so the "
"counts of files and images will decrease. The removed hits are archived in "
"the table \"hit_duplicate\", to check then to empty, or to restore. The task "
"is also available in the module Easy Admin."
msgstr ""

